      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have several concerns about approving this CL in its current state:\n\n1. **Unresolved Comments:** It seems open issues were closed with \"follow up in later CL.\"\nPer go/review-pushback#later, it\u0027s preferable to address them now. Could we revisit those discussions?\n\n2. **Inheritance Pattern:** While the \"design review\" may have had a different outcome, I don\u0027t believe extending ProfileService is the most suitable pattern in this case.\nCan we discuss alternative approaches that might be more appropriate?  \nIs there a specific reason why extending ProfileService was chosen?\n\n3. **Code Utilization:**  The current code appears to be unused without the consuming code in the framework and other locations.\nFor clarity and maintainability, it would be better to merge once we have a clearer picture of how this code will be integrated.\nCan you upload the whole chain of CL making usage of this ?",
      "revId": "f1a20a6054a4d6c1fe319eaa14c0e6342270152d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "cf73bcd3_922660ca",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
